# Wrong fault-catch enum qualifier (error-model.md §11 Increment 2 (D)): a
# fault-catch pattern can only name a `Fault` variant. `Bogus.Overflow` must be
# REJECTED at typecheck, not silently accepted as `Fault.Overflow`.
void main():
    int big = 9223372036854775807
    int r = (big * 2) catch Bogus.Overflow: -1
    print(f"{r}")
